    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><em>“You already know. You just refuse to say it too early.”</em></p><p><strong>Archetype (Bad Eden): The High Priestess (Seer).</strong> You read the invisible pressure in a room before anyone else admits it exists. You are intuition weaponized, omen-bearing, and very difficult to surprise in ways that matter.</p><h3>Archetype Effects</h3><ul><li><strong>Faction Edge.</strong> Your archetype sharpens the faction’s hidden-state awareness and information leverage. This Archetype is associated with <strong>+1 Intrigue</strong> in faction calculus in Bad Eden’s faction calculus.</li><li><strong>Tier Engine.</strong> See this Archetype’s Tier feats (Tier 1–4) for your full tactical and strategic toolkit; those are granted automatically by the Tier Engine at the appropriate character levels.</li></ul>",
